  "description": "ADVENTURE AWAITS. The new GRAVELATOR Carbon Series takes the gravel experience to the next level. Combining cutting-edge technology with the feeling of limitless freedom, it is built for riders who see every ride as an opportunity for a new adventure. At the heart of the series is the all-new carbon frame developed for model year 2026. Featuring FIS – Full Integrated Storage, seamlessly integrated into the downtube, it combines smart functionality with a clean and modern design. Tools, nutrition, and spare parts are securely stored and always within easy reach. For even greater comfort, the geometry of the new GRAVELATOR models has been refined. The result is a balanced riding position that remains comfortable on long days in the saddle without compromising agility, precision, or handling. Whether it's epic gravel adventures, multi-day bikepacking trips, or spontaneous explorations beyond the beaten path, the GRAVELATOR models are ready for it all. Numerous mounting points provide ample space for bags and gear, while the innovative Flexibridge allows fenders to be installed quickly, securely, and effortlessly.",
